BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 740.90 Tm (Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 727.80 Tm (I have explained the problem, why accessibility matters and what we hope to show. My teammate) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 715.70 Tm (    Shyamantika Pegu will now explain how the system works, how hand points become numbers and how) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 703.60 Tm (    the trained model makes a prediction.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 686.50 Tm (Look toward Shyamantika and pause before handing over.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 664.40 Tm (Questions judges may ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 647.40 Tm (Q: Is sign language the same around the world?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 634.30 Tm (A: No. Different sign languages exist, and each has its own rules.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 617.20 Tm (Q: Does SAHAYAK translate every ISL sentence?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 604.10 Tm (A: No. It recognizes a limited set of trained labels. Full sign-language translation is much) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 592.00 Tm (    harder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 574.90 Tm (Q: Can it replace an interpreter?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 561.80 Tm (A: No. It is an educational prototype, not a substitute for a trained interpreter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 544.70 Tm (Q: Why is it useful if it has limits?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 531.60 Tm (A: It lets us explore an assistive-technology idea, learn about recognition and test how it can) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 519.50 Tm (    improve.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 502.40 Tm (Q: Does it always work offline?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 489.30 Tm (A: No. Live predictions and some translation or speech features need internet access.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 467.20 Tm (Practice checklist) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 450.20 Tm (- Practise the opening and handover aloud.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 437.10 Tm (- Speak clearly and look at the judges instead of reading every word.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 424.00 Tm (- Use the census number only with its correct meaning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 410.90 Tm (- Do not claim an accuracy percentage unless a real test report supports it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 397.80 Tm (- If asked about something you do not know, say you will verify it rather than guessing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 0.05 0.30 0.55 rg 1 0 0 1 42 375.70 Tm (One-sentence summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 358.70 Tm (I explain why SAHAYAK was built, what problem it explores, and why it is a limited) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 346.60 Tm (    sign-recognition prototype rather than a full sign-language translator.) Tj ET
